"Privacy Policy | Voitto Ventures\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nLast updated: 24/12/25\n\nVoitto Ventures (\u201cwe\u201d, \u201cour\u201d, \u201cus\u201d) respects your privacy and is committed to protecting the personal information you share with us through our website https://www.voittoventures.com/ .\n\n1. Information We Collect\n\nWhen you use our website or submit forms, we may collect the following information:\n\nName\n\nEmail address\n\nPhone number\n\nProperty preference\n\nBooking or enquiry details\n\nAny additional information you voluntarily provide\n\n2. How We Use Your Information\n\nWe use your information to:\n\nRespond to enquiries and booking requests\n\nProvide information about our resorts and services\n\nImprove our website and customer experience\n\nCommunicate with you regarding your request\n\nWe do not sell or rent your personal data to third parties.\n\n3. Sharing of Information\n\nYour personal information may be shared only with:\n\nAuthorized staff or management of Voitto Ventures\n\nTrusted service providers (such as email or website services) strictly for operational purposes\n\nAll such parties are required to keep your information confidential.\n\n4. Data Security\n\nWe take reasonable security measures to protect your personal data from unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure. Our website uses HTTPS (SSL encryption) to ensure secure data transmission.\n\n5. Cookies\n\nOur website may use cookies to improve user experience and analyze website traffic. You can choose to disable cookies through your browser settings if you prefer.\n\n6. Your Rights\n\nYou have the right to:\n\nRequest access to your personal information\n\nRequest correction or deletion of your data\n\nWithdraw consent for communication at any time\n\nTo exercise these rights, please contact us using the details below.\n\n7. Third-Party Links\n\nOur website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites.\n\n8. Changes to This Privacy Policy\n\nWe may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.\n\n9. Contact Us\n\nIf you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or how we handle your data, please contact us at: Website: https://www.voittoventures.com/\n\n"
